    "characterClassLevel() in class-features.js for the same idea applied to",
    "features) — not the character's total level. `slotsByLevel` maps a level",
    "(as a string key, '1'..'20') to an array of nine numbers: how many slots",
    "of spell level 1 through 9 a character of that class level has. A class",
    "not listed here grants no spell slots at all — read through",
    "spellSlotsForClass() in src/js/spells.js, never off this file directly.",
